---

<section class="w-full bg-surface-container-low py-space-lg border-y border-surface-variant" aria-label="Pilares de confianza">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-margin-mobile lg:px-margin">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-space-md">
      <!-- Metric 01 -->
      <div class="p-space-lg bg-surface-container flex flex-col justify-between border border-outline-variant/30 hover:border-primary-container/40 transition-colors">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-space-sm">
          <span class="font-label-caps text-label-caps uppercase text-primary-container tracking-widest">CRITERIO ESPACIAL</span>
          <span class="font-index-numeral text-headline-lg text-outline" aria-hidden="true">01</span>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h2 class="font-headline-md text-headline-md uppercase text-on-surface mb-space-xs">GRUPOS REDUCIDOS</h2>
          <p class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">
            Entrena con espacio, sin esperas por el material y con corrección técnica continua en cada levantamiento.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Metric 02 -->
      <div class="p-space-lg bg-surface-container flex flex-col justify-between border border-outline-variant/30 hover:border-secondary/40 transition-colors">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-space-sm">
          <span class="font-label-caps text-label-caps uppercase text-secondary tracking-widest">COMPROMISO REAL</span>
          <span class="font-index-numeral text-headline-lg text-outline" aria-hidden="true">02</span>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h2 class="font-headline-md text-headline-md uppercase text-on-surface mb-space-xs">SIN PERMANENCIA NI MATRÍCULA</h2>
          <p class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">
            Flexibilidad mensual real. Te quedas porque mejoras y notas el cambio, nunca por la atadura de un contrato.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Metric 03 -->
      <div class="p-space-lg bg-surface-container flex flex-col justify-between border border-outline-variant/30 hover:border-primary-container/40 transition-colors">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-space-sm">
          <span class="font-label-caps text-label-caps uppercase text-primary-container tracking-widest">METODOLOGÍA</span>
          <span class="font-index-numeral text-headline-lg text-outline" aria-hidden="true">03</span>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h2 class="font-headline-md text-headline-md uppercase text-on-surface mb-space-xs">PROGRAMACIÓN POR BLOQUES</h2>
          <p class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">
            Planificación estructurada de fuerza e hipertrofia. Sabes exactamente qué levantar cada semana sin improvisar.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Metric 04 -->
      <div class="p-space-lg bg-surface-container flex flex-col justify-between border border-outline-variant/30 hover:border-secondary/40 transition-colors">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-space-sm">
          <span class="font-label-caps text-label-caps uppercase text-secondary tracking-widest">EQUIPAMIENTO</span>
          <span class="font-index-numeral text-headline-lg text-outline" aria-hidden="true">04</span>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h2 class="font-headline-md text-headline-md uppercase text-on-surface mb-space-xs">MATERIAL TÉCNICO PRO</h2>
          <p class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">
            Barras olímpicas calibradas, discos bumper, trineo de arrastre, SkiErg y suelo técnico de alta absorción.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
